    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "An example implementation of the handler block is as follows:",
      "ko": "핸들러 블록의 예제 구현은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4ccca065ef44f54d764d05522b8a0fd7b435e06220a82dc2154b830394c9236d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n@IBAction func beginTrimming(_ sender: AnyObject) {\n    playerView.beginTrimming { result in\n        if result == .okButton {\n            // user selected Trim button (AVPlayerViewTrimResult.okButton)...\n        } else {\n            // user selected Cancel button (AVPlayerViewTrimResult.cancelButton)...\n        }\n    }\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n@IBAction func beginTrimming(_ sender: AnyObject) {\n    playerView.beginTrimming { result in\n        if result == .okButton {\n            // user selected Trim button (AVPlayerViewTrimResult.okButton)...\n        } else {\n            // user selected Cancel button (AVPlayerViewTrimResult.cancelButton)...\n        }\n    }\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "8f98a2485fc9ab1f835225f7622f09434ad65fb0971aaffbeb36ff6c19631319",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "This method blocks until the user selects either the Trim or the Cancel button.",
      "ko": "이 메서드는 사용자가 Trim 또는 Cancel 버튼 중 하나를 선택할 때까지 블록됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f836ab7c782f79d4171b63f2957d2515243186fd73e04422294ae8d2285b1217",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
